    "Press Run to time this workflow": "點擊「執行」以計時此工作流程",
    "Already ComfyUI-compatible (not the fal format). Nothing to convert - it should load in ComfyUI directly.": "已相容 ComfyUI（非 fal 格式）。無需轉換 — 應可直接在 ComfyUI 中載入。",
    "Trigger words": "觸發詞",
    "from file": "從檔案讀取",
    "Tap the ones you want. Only these, and only if the LoRA is on, reach the triggers output.": "點選您需要的觸發詞。僅這些詞（且僅當 LoRA 啟用時）會傳到觸發詞輸出。",
    "No trigger words in this file - add your own below, or try Civitai.": "此檔案中無觸發詞 — 請在下方自行新增，或嘗試從 Civitai 取得。",
