    "preview": "預覽",
    "Set Pixaroma": "設定為 Pixaroma",
    "Home": "首頁",
    "🚀 Start here": "🚀 從這裡開始",
    "🎨 Editors": "🎨 編輯器",
    "🖼️ Image": "🖼️ 圖像",
    "✂️ Resize & Crop": "✂️ 調整大小與裁剪",
    "Image Crop Pixaroma": "圖像裁剪 Pixaroma",
    "Image Resize Pixaroma": "圖像調整大小 Pixaroma",
    "Image Uncrop Pixaroma": "圖像反裁剪 Pixaroma",
    "Inpaint Crop Pixaroma": "局部重繪裁剪 Pixaroma",
    "Inpaint Stitch Pixaroma": "局部重繪拼接 Pixaroma",
    "Outpaint Pixaroma": "擴繪 Pixaroma",
    "Outpaint Stitch Pixaroma": "擴繪拼接 Pixaroma",
    "Resize Crop Pixaroma": "調整大小並裁剪 Pixaroma",
    "💬 Prompt & Text": "💬 提示詞與文字",
    "📝 Notes & Overlay": "📝 備註與疊加",
    "🔢 Values": "🔢 數值",
    "🔀 Logic & Flow": "🔀 邏輯與流程",
    "🧰 Utility": "🧰 實用工具",
    "✨ Canvas tools": "✨ 畫布工具",
    "Crop any image visually with a draggable handle - no typing pixel coordinates.": "透過可拖曳的手柄直觀裁剪任意圖像 — 無需手動輸入像素座標。",
    "+ Add to canvas": "+ 新增到畫布",
    "Copy as text": "複製為文字",
    "What it does": "功能說明",
    "Three ways to load a source image: wire any upstream IMAGE into the input slot, drag and drop a file onto the node body, or paste from the clipboard with Ctrl+V. Drag-drop and paste auto-disconnect the upstream wire so your loaded image takes over.": "載入來源圖像有三種方式：將任意上游 IMAGE 連接到輸入槽、將檔案拖放到節點主體上、或使用 Ctrl+V 從剪貼簿貼上。拖放與貼上會自動斷開上游連線，使您載入的圖像取代其位置。",
    "How to use": "使用方法",
    "Wire an upstream IMAGE, drag a file onto the node, or paste with Ctrl+V。": "連接上游 IMAGE、將檔案拖到節點上、或使用 Ctrl+V 貼上。",
    "Adjust the crop rectangle using the panel fields or click Open Crop Editor for the fullscreen editor with handles.": "使用面板欄位調整裁剪矩形，或點擊「開啟裁剪編輯器」以使用帶手柄的全螢幕編輯器。",
    "Run the workflow to output the cropped result.": "執行工作流程以輸出裁剪結果。",
    "To put an edited crop back later, wire the crop_info output into Image Uncrop Pixaroma.": "如需稍後將編輯後的裁剪內容放回原圖，請將 crop_info 輸出連接到 Image Uncrop Pixaroma。",
    "The cropped image.": "裁剪後的圖像。",
    "The cropped mask, cut with the same box as the image. Wire a MASK in (such as Load Image's MASK) to carry transparency through the crop; otherwise it is a fully-opaque mask sized to the crop.": "裁剪後的遮罩，與圖像使用相同的裁剪框。連接 MASK 輸入（例如 Load Image 的 MASK 輸出）可在裁剪時保留透明度；否則將產生一個與裁剪區域大小一致的不透明遮罩。",
    "crop_info": "裁剪資訊",
    "Feed this into Image Uncrop Pixaroma to paste an edited version of the crop back onto the original image at the exact same spot.": "將此輸出接到 Image Uncrop Pixaroma，可將編輯後的裁剪內容精確貼回原圖像的相同位置。",
    "Width of the cropped area in pixels.": "裁剪區域的寬度（像素）。",
    "Height of the cropped area in pixels.": "裁剪區域的高度（像素）。",
    "What you wire in": "輸入說明",
    "Wire any upstream IMAGE here to crop it (Load Image, VAE Decode, ControlNet output, anything). You can also drag-drop an image file onto the node body or paste one with Ctrl+V - those load the image directly and disconnect this wire.": "在此連接任意上游 IMAGE 以進行裁剪（如 Load Image、VAE Decode、ControlNet 輸出等）。您也可以將圖像檔案拖放到節點主體上，或使用 Ctrl+V 貼上 — 這些操作將直接載入圖像並斷開此連線。",
    "Optional. Wire a MASK here (for example Load Image's MASK output) to crop the transparency with the exact same box as the image - the result comes out the 'mask' output. Leave it unwired and the mask output is a fully-opaque mask sized to the crop (unless the loaded file itself has transparency, which is used automatically).": "選填。在此連接 MASK（例如 Load Image 的 MASK 輸出），可使用與圖像完全相同的裁剪框來裁剪透明度 — 結果將從 'mask' 輸出端輸出。如不連接，則 mask 輸出為與裁剪區域大小一致的不透明遮罩（除非載入的檔案本身包含透明度，則會自動使用）。",
    "Start here": "從這裡開始",
    "Keeping the nodes up to date, opening a downloaded workflow, the fix for most “it looks broken” reports, and where to ask when none of that helps.": "保持節點更新、開啟已下載的工作流程、修復大多數「看起來壞了」的問題，以及當以上均無效時該到哪裡尋求協助。",
    "Update the nodes": "更新節點",
    "Three ways to get the newest version, in the order to try them.": "按建議嘗試順序排列的三種取得最新版本的方式。",
    "Run a downloaded workflow": "執行已下載的工作流程",
    "Two ways to open a workflow file you downloaded.": "開啟您已下載的工作流程檔案的兩種方式。",
    "Buttons or nodes missing?": "按鈕或節點缺失？",
    "Almost always the browser cache. Here is the five second fix.": "幾乎都是瀏覽器快取所致。以下是五秒修復方法。",
    "Need help?": "需要協助？",
    "Where to ask, and what to include so you get an answer quickly.": "該到哪裡提問，以及應包含哪些資訊以便快速獲得解答。",
    "Browse everything": "瀏覽全部",
    "drag a node card onto the canvas to place it": "將節點卡片拖到畫布上以放置",
    "Group Switch Pixaroma": "群組開關 Pixaroma",
    "On/off switches for your Pixaroma Groups, in one small panel.": "在一個小面板中為您的 Pixaroma 群組提供開關控制。",
    "Logic & Flow": "邏輯與流程",
    "Run Log Pixaroma": "執行日誌 Pixaroma",
    "Keeps the last 10 run times for this workflow on the canvas.": "在畫布上保留此工作流程最近 10 次的執行時間。",
    "Control Panel Pixaroma": "控制面板 Pixaroma",
    "Every dial and switch you care about, gathered into one panel that drives your whole workflow.": "將所有您在乎的旋鈕與開關集中到一個面板中，驅動整個工作流程。",
    "Run Timer Pixaroma": "執行計時器 Pixaroma",
    "Times how long a workflow takes, and chimes when it is done.": "計時工作流程執行所需時間，並在完成時發出提示音。",
    "Load Image Mini Pixaroma": "載入圖像 Mini Pixaroma",
    "A compact Load Image: upload, pick, preview, and just two outputs. All the resize controls tuck into the gear.": "精簡版載入圖像：上傳、選取、預覽，僅兩個輸出。所有調整大小控件都收納在齒輪設定中。",
    "Image Info Pixaroma": "圖像資訊 Pixaroma",
    "Unpacks the image_info bundle from Load Image Mini into the mask, size and filename you need.": "從 Load Image Mini 解包 image_info 資料，提取所需的遮罩、尺寸與檔案名。",
    "Add a solid-colour border around your image so an outpainting model can paint new scenery into it.": "在圖像周圍新增單色邊框，以便擴繪模型可以在其中繪製新場景。",
    "Resize & Crop": "調整大小與裁剪",
    "Put your pristine original back onto an outpaint result, keeping only the newly generated area.": "將原始圖像放回擴繪結果中，僅保留新生成的區域。",
    "Seed Pixaroma": "隨機種子 Pixaroma",
    "A seed source with one-click random and fixed control - wire it into any sampler's seed input.": "可一鍵隨機與固定的種子來源 — 可連接到任何採樣器的種子輸入。",
    "Loop Start Pixaroma": "循環開始 Pixaroma",
    "The opening bracket of a loop - repeat a section of your workflow a set number of times.": "循環的起始括號 — 將工作流程的某段重複執行指定次數。",
    "Loop End Pixaroma": "循環結束 Pixaroma",
    "The closing bracket of a loop - sends each round back around, then outputs the final result.": "循環的結束括號 — 將每一輪送回重新執行，然後輸出最終結果。",
    "Combine Pixaroma": "合併 Pixaroma",
    "Join two inputs into one batch - images, video frames, latents, numbers, or text.": "將兩個輸入合併為一個批次 — 圖像、影片影格、Latent、數字或文字。",
    "3D Builder Pixaroma": "3D 建構器 Pixaroma",
    "A full 3D scene editor inside ComfyUI - build, light, and render scenes without leaving your workflow.": "ComfyUI 內建的完整 3D 場景編輯器 — 無需離開工作流程即可建立、佈光與渲染場景。",
    "Paint Pixaroma": "繪畫 Pixaroma",
    "A layered painting editor inside ComfyUI - draw, retouch, and compose on stacked layers.": "ComfyUI 內建的圖層式繪畫編輯器 — 在疊加的圖層上繪製、修飾與合成。",
    "Image Composer Pixaroma": "圖像合成器 Pixaroma",
    "A layer-based image compositor inside ComfyUI - arrange, blend, and grade multiple images on one canvas.": "ComfyUI 內建的圖層式圖像合成器 — 在單一畫布上排列、混合與調色多張圖像。",
    "Paste an edited crop back onto the original image at the exact spot it came from.": "將編輯後的裁剪內容精確貼回原圖像的來源位置。",
    "The easy way to set up an inpaint - paint a mask, get a model-ready crop automatically.": "設定局部重繪的簡便方法 — 繪製遮罩，自動取得可供模型使用的裁剪區域。",
    "Paste your inpainted crop back onto the original, blended so the seam disappears.": "將局部重繪後的裁剪內容貼回原圖，經混合使接縫消失。",
    "AudioReact Pixaroma": "音訊反應 Pixaroma",
    "Turn a still image into an audio-reactive video - motion and effects that move with the beat.": "將靜態圖像轉換為音訊反應影片 — 動態與特效跟著節拍律動。",
    "Note Pixaroma": "備註 Pixaroma",
    "A rich-text annotation that lives on your canvas - no wires, no outputs.": "位於畫布上的富文字註解 — 無需連線，無輸出。",
    "Notes & Overlay": "備註與疊加",
    "Prompt Multi Pixaroma": "多重提示詞 Pixaroma",
    "A prompt library with two run modes - queue one image per prompt, or send all prompts as a list.": "具有兩種執行模式的提示詞庫 — 每個提示詞排隊產生一張圖像，或將所有提示詞以清單送出。",
    "Prompt & Text": "提示詞與文字",
    "Prompt Pack Pixaroma": "提示詞包 Pixaroma",
    "Paste a block of prompts and queue one workflow run per prompt automatically.": "貼上一組提示詞，自動為每個提示詞排隊執行一次工作流程。",
    "Prompt Stack Pixaroma": "提示詞堆疊 Pixaroma",
    "Build one combined prompt from a list of toggleable chunks.": "由可切換的片段清單建立一個組合提示詞。",
    "Prompt From List Pixaroma": "從清單取提示詞 Pixaroma",
    "Picks one prompt by number from a Prompt Multi list.": "從 Prompt Multi 清單中依編號選取一個提示詞。",
    "Show Text Pixaroma": "顯示文字 Pixaroma",
    "Inspect anything flowing through your workflow - images, prompts, numbers - in a readable text box.": "在易讀的文字方塊中檢視流經工作流程的任何內容 — 圖像、提示詞、數字。",
    "Prompt Reader Pixaroma": "提示詞讀取器 Pixaroma",
    "Pull the positive prompt saved inside any ComfyUI or Automatic1111 PNG back out as usable text.": "將儲存在任何 ComfyUI 或 Automatic1111 PNG 中的正向提示詞提取為可用文字。",
    "Load Image Pixaroma": "載入圖像 Pixaroma",
    "Load an image with built-in resize - max megapixels, longest side, fit inside, crop to fill, and more - in one node.": "在單一節點中載入圖像並內建調整大小功能 — 最大百萬像素、最長邊、置於內部、裁剪填滿等。",
    "Save Image Pixaroma": "儲存圖像 Pixaroma",
    "Save images to any folder on your computer, with a live preview of the exact filename.": "將圖像儲存到電腦上的任何資料夾，並即時預覽確切的檔案名。",
    "Load Images from Folder Pixaroma": "從資料夾載入圖像 Pixaroma",
    "Load many images from any folder and run your workflow on each one, one at a time.": "從任何資料夾載入多張圖像，並逐一對每張圖像執行工作流程。",
    "Preview Image Pixaroma": "預覽圖像 Pixaroma",
    "Inline image preview with Save, Copy, and Open buttons - batch-aware, with a Strip or Grid layout.": "內嵌圖像預覽，附儲存、複製與開啟按鈕 — 支援批次處理，提供條狀或網格佈局。",
    "Save Mp4 Pixaroma": "儲存 MP4 Pixaroma",
    "Encode a frame batch to an H.264 mp4 with optional audio, and watch it play right on the node.": "將影格批次編碼為可附音訊的 H.264 MP4，並直接在節點上播放檢視。",
    "Load Video Pixaroma": "載入影片 Pixaroma",
    "Upload or pick a video, decode it to frames plus audio and info, and preview it right on the node.": "上傳或選取影片，解碼為影格序列及音訊與資訊，並直接在節點上預覽。",
    "Load Video Frame Pixaroma": "載入影片影格 Pixaroma",
    "Load a video and pick one exact frame to use as an image. Like a Load Image node, but for video.": "載入影片並選取一個精確影格用作圖像。類似 Load Image 節點，但用於影片。",
    "Resize an image (and its mask) mid-workflow using a set of smart resize modes.": "在工作流程執行中以一組智慧調整大小模式變換圖像（及其遮罩）的尺寸。",
    "Force an image to an exact width and height by crop-to-fill - no stretching, no letterboxing.": "透過裁剪填滿將圖像強制為精確的寬度與高度 — 不拉伸、不帶黑邊。",
    "Portrait Landscape Pixaroma": "直橫向切換 Pixaroma",
    "Flip a width and height between portrait (tall) and landscape (wide) with one click.": "一鍵在直向（高）與橫向（寬）之間交換寬度與高度。",
    "Remove Background Pixaroma": "移除背景 Pixaroma",
    "Cut out the foreground from an image using a BiRefNet AI model.": "使用 BiRefNet AI 模型從圖像中摳出前景。",
    "Pause Image Pixaroma": "暫停圖像 Pixaroma",
    "Pause your workflow mid-run to review an image before the expensive part runs.": "在工作流程執行中途暫停，在耗時部分執行前檢視圖像。",
    "Pause Text Pixaroma": "暫停文字 Pixaroma",
    "Pause your workflow to read and fix a piece of text before the rest runs.": "暫停工作流程，在後續執行前檢視並修正一段文字。",
    "Switch Pixaroma": "開關 Pixaroma",
    "Route one of many wired inputs to a single output by clicking a row.": "透過點擊一列，將多個已連線輸入中的其中之一路由到單一輸出。",
    "Switch WH Pixaroma": "寬高開關 Pixaroma",
    "Toggle between two width/height pairs with one click.": "一鍵在兩組寬高組合之間切換。",
    "Switch Source Pixaroma": "來源切換 Pixaroma",
    "Flip a whole set of wires between two setups (A and B) with one toggle.": "透過一個開關在兩組設定（A 與 B）之間切換整組連線。",
    "Mute Switch Pixaroma": "靜音開關 Pixaroma",
    "Toggle whole workflow branches on and off with per-scene pills.": "透過場景標籤開關整個工作流程分支。",
    "Resolution Pixaroma": "解析度 Pixaroma",
    "One-click resolution picker for AI image sizes, with ratio chips, snap, custom ratios, and math.": "一鍵 AI 圖像尺寸解析度選擇器，包含比例標籤、吸附、自訂比例與計算。",
    "Number Pixaroma": "數字 Pixaroma",
