    "Adds a styled text layer on top of an image, with a fullscreen editor for precise placement.": "在圖像上方新增帶樣式的文字圖層，並提供全螢幕編輯器以精確定位。",
    "Text Watermark Pixaroma": "文字浮水印 Pixaroma",
