    "Find and Replace Pixaroma": "尋找與取代 Pixaroma",
    "Sits in a text wire and rewrites the text flowing through it, before it reaches whatever uses the prompt.": "位於文字連線中，在文字抵達使用提示詞的節點之前對其進行改寫。",
    "Image Compare Pixaroma": "圖像比較 Pixaroma",
