    "Krea LoRA Converter": "Krea LoRA 轉換器",
    "Make a fal.ai Krea 2 LoRA work in ComfyUI.": "讓 fal.ai Krea 2 LoRA 能在 ComfyUI 中運作。",
    "XY Plot Pixaroma": "XY 繪圖 Pixaroma",
    "Compare settings side by side in one labeled grid - no extra wiring.": "在帶標籤的單一網格中並排比較設定 — 無需額外連線。",
    "Label Pixaroma": "標籤 Pixaroma",
    "A floating text caption for documenting your workflow. Double-click a label on the canvas to open this editor.": "用於記錄工作流程的浮動文字標題。雙擊畫布上的標籤即可開啟此編輯器。",
    "Text Pixaroma": "文字 Pixaroma",
    "A multi-line text box with a single text output. Type once, wire it into as many nodes as you like.": "多行文字方塊，帶單一文字輸出。輸入一次，即可連線到任意數量的節點。",
    "Prompt Pixaroma": "提示詞 Pixaroma",
    "A prompt box with reusable @tags, random slots, and an optional text input you can join with.": "帶可重複使用 @標籤、隨機槽位與可選文字輸入的提示詞框，可與之連接。",
    "LoRA Loader Pixaroma": "LoRA 載入器 Pixaroma",
    "Stack many LoRAs in one node, with trigger words read straight from each file.": "在單一節點中堆疊多個 LoRA，觸發詞直接從每個檔案讀取。",
    "Store any wire under a name, then read it back anywhere with Get Pixaroma.": "將任意連線以名稱儲存，然後使用 Get Pixaroma 在任何地方讀取回來。",
    "Get Pixaroma": "取得 Pixaroma",
    "Read a value that a Set Pixaroma node stored under a name, with no cable.": "無需連線即可讀取 Set Pixaroma 節點以名稱儲存的值。",
    "Nodes snap to line up with each other as you drag, with a guide showing what they lined up with.": "拖曳節點時，節點會自動彼此對齊，並顯示對齊參考線。",
    "Canvas tools": "畫布工具",
    "Node Colors": "節點顏色",
    "Right-click any node or group to recolour it, with favourites and copy and paste.": "右鍵點擊任意節點或群組即可重新上色，支援收藏與複製貼上顏色。",
    "Pixaroma Group": "Pixaroma 群組",
    "A group container with Run, Mute, Bypass and Fold buttons built into its header.": "群組容器，其標題欄內建執行、靜音、跳過與收合按鈕。",
    "Connection FX": "連線特效",
